Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，废话少说，有请你们的追求者——亚当·克伦威尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, without further ado, your suitor, Adam Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:09.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是英国克伦威尔酒店帝国的继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the British heir to the Cromwell Hotel fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当时想开一家新酒店……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was trying to open a new hotel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己的，不靠我父亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My own, without my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}王室万人迷脱裤，跟三个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Royal hottie drops trou with three...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，抱歉，是四个妓女吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or, I'm sorry, was it four hookers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后还发推特晒自拍？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then tweets a selfie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去你的。我不认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw you. I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认识你。至少，我知道你的目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you. Or, at least, I know your agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会往你的酒店投钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody's gonna bet money on your hotel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你先挽回形象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until you rehab your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝，嘿，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace, hey, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想赢得亚当，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to win Adam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就得改变你的做派。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're just gonna have to change your act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是不想让亚当和我在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just don't want Adam to be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看过你看他的眼神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen the way you look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我还挺喜欢你这样损我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I kind of like it, though, the way you're busting my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样，好吗？嗯哼。不行？确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do that, okay? Mnh-mnh. No? Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:39.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，不行。我们别跑题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, no. Let's just stay on topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的摄影指导要离开我们了。敬卡尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our D.P. here is leaving us. To Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要卡尔的工作。你帮我弄到手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want Carl's job. I want you to get it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因听得进你的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got Quinn's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你早就该跟她谈了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should have talked to her a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你陷进这行？不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And commit you to this? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抽身离开是你的梦想，不是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Getting out was your dream. It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我这辈子唯一做对的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only thing in my life that I've ever done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我手臂发麻。快打911。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My arm's tingling. Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！我需要救护车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aah! I need an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:00:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，心脏病发作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:01:00.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特是不好搞，但他需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet's not easy, but he needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，我想谢谢你跟他睡了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I wanted to thank you for sleeping with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样他就不会跑太远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It keeps him from wandering too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:05.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可真高尚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a real class act.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中一次约会必须安排在我纳帕的酒店工地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One of the dates has to be at my hotel site in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，没问题吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Done, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在快回去工作，你个英国佬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, just get back to work, you limey pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚在《永恒》节目中，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩下最后十位参赛者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's down to our final 10 contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经历了上周的情感过山车后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And after last week's emotional roller coaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的追求者越来越难开口告别了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's becoming far more difficult for our suitor to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:32.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才那段不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:34.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鸡皮疙瘩。寒毛直竖。你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goosebumps. Chills. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才那段，真的挺棒的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was, like, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得大家会想我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think people are gonna miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，你有这个魅力，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, you have got it, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我，全世界都会爱上你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me. The world is gonna love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我不该走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I shouldn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以跟制片人说，让我回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could talk to the producers, have me come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以弄成个惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It could be like a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。你太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. You are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的车会送你去机场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My car will take you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们五分钟后，呃，就进女生房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll be heading in the girls' room in just, uh, five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们为什么一点都不透露这次集体约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why won't they tell us anything about this group date?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的意思是，我们该怎么准备？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, how are we supposed to prepare?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们连谁去都不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we don't even know who's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你不用担心这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You might not have to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄影机就位，姑娘们！来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cameras on the floor, ladies! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.89,0:02:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄影机就位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cameras on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:35.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没准备好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门要开了！他们来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doors are opening! Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开拍！开拍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling! Rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.33,0:02:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开拍！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:45.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。戏可真多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. It is so much drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好像她们不是刚花了四个小时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like they didn't all just spend four hours
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为这个化妆似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}getting made up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整天玩换装可真辛苦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So hard playing dress up all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:03:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“诚邀您到我在纳帕的葡萄园一聚。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"You are cordially invited to join me at my vineyard in Napa."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“一个对我意义非凡的地方。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A place that is near and dear to my heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“这座葡萄园是我对未来的愿景，”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"This vineyard is my vision for the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我想在这里想象我未来妻子的样子。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I want to envision my future wife in it."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。听起来太好玩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh. That sounds like so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没收到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。什么场合？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. What's the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:29.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把鸟窝头换掉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ditched the birds-nest look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真迷人。真迷人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very charming. Very charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可是没什么……没什么不一样啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but nothing... Nothing's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别闹了行吗？我有时候也画眼线。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you stop? I wear eyeliner sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我画啊。什么时候开始的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do. Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:44.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你、你怎么在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, wh-what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们本来要跟摄影指导去勘察葡萄园的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're supposed to be scouting the vineyard with the D.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你眼前的就是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're looking at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，你接了卡尔的工作？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait a second, you got Carl's job?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊！别闹了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我拿到了。我是说，你跟奎因说的那些话显然奏效了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I got it. I mean, whatever you said to Quinn obviously paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。真为你高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations. Very happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:00.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。开工吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别一副中了彩票的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can stop acting like you won the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这场约会显然只是个安慰奖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This date is obviously just a consolation prize
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给B组的安慰奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the "B" team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续这么骗自己吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会直奔四强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm heading straight to the final four.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}靠耍那套NeNe的把戏？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By pulling that NeNe crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:16.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续跟权力对着干，然后准备收拾行李吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You keep fighting the power and get ready to pack your bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得那位白人陛下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How long do you really think his royal whiteness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会留着个惹事的黑鬼婊子在身边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is gonna keep around some black bitch stirring up trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜……你撑不过这一周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My guess... you're not gonna last the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿风景太美了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gorgeous out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话可一点不带讽刺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Said without irony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今天怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被判危房了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Condemned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，拜托告诉我这是个玩笑，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, please tell me that this is a joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正的葡萄园在别处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that the real vineyard's somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。这节目就是这么干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. This is what this show does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就施展你的好莱坞魔法吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just work your Hollywood magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:05:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可没法从屁股里变出独角兽，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't pull unicorns out of our asses, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方简直一团糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place is a total disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这要求有点过分，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it's a lot to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但要说有谁能把这事办成，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but if there's anyone I can trust to make this happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:07.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我……抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才是不是真打算靠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you actually seriously just try to win me over
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那副小狗眼神来收买我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with your puppy-dog eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才是这么回事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个嘛，合同里写着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it is in my contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦对，现在我知道为什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, right, and now I see why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让节目组\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're trying to get the show
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来修好这个鬼地方了。没什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to fix up this hellscape. Nothing major.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要上镜好看、能做点宣传就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just enough to look good on camera for some publicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:24.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而《永恒》还能白得个漂亮地方约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meanwhile, "Everlasting" gets a lovely place for a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是双赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's win-win, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，才不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我来说不是，因为我得一天内拍完\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not for me because I have to shoot it in a day
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还得控制住预算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and bring it in on budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿没电。我得再要台发电机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Electricity's off. I'm gonna need an extra gennie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:33.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是给灯供电用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just to run power to the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。发电机想都别想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no. Screw the gennie, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没钱在这儿搞维修。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't afford to do repairs onsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我得请来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, i-i would have to bring in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一整支施工队才行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a full-on construction crew for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带几个人过来，行吗？我们来修。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll bring some of the guys out, you know? We'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没想让摄影组干这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not asking the camera department to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要给我供电就行。他们现在是我的人了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get me power. They're my guys now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:46.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们让我好看，我们都好看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They make me look good, we all look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也能帮忙。这样吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I can help out, too. Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是那些马球小马闹起来，我通知你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll let you know if the polo ponies get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.09,0:05:54.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望那家伙心里有数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope that guy knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:59.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，那家伙是在救你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, that guy is saving your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该感激他才对，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should be grateful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超预算一万？你疯了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10 grand over budget? Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，那葡萄园潜力巨大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, the vineyard has crazy potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？行了，这样吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? All right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:07.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你没法控制住预算，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you can't get it on budget,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就把它挪到费尔曼酒店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just move it over to the Fairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会付钱给我们的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll pay us for the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，我们必须在那儿拍。是你写进亚当合同里的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we have to shoot there. You put it in Adam's contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这地方就是俗称的破烂货，好吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe this place is what they call ratchet, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:17.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以告他违约，速度快得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could sue him for breach of contract so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能拧断他那苍白的英国脖子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it will snap his pasty English neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我觉得我能控制住预算。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, I think I can bring it on budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我个机会，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me a chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行。你最好如此。就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. You better. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，能麻烦你签一下这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Um, can I just get you to sign that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:26.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，不行。我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no. I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。你的小跟班出问题了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. Trouble with mini-me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，只是在想办法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, just trying to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么在周末前把亚当的葡萄园修好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}how to fix Adam's vineyard for this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}修？我以为克伦威尔家只持有五星级产业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fix it? I thought the Cromwells only own five-star properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个可不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:38.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}破烂不堪。好几年没人维护了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's trashed. No upkeep for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那位女王陛下的蠢货一点营销头脑都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}her majesty's dumbass has no marketing savvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}节目结束后，他只要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After the show's done, all he has to do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它包装成"亚当·克伦威尔的永恒浪漫度假地"卖出去就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is sell it as Adam Cromwell's Retreat for Everlasting Romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可惜他没有你这样的人。你总能把事情办成。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too bad he doesn't have a you. You always make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，他真可惜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, too bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我知道你还在为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I know you're still pissed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:57.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医院那事生气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about what happened at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有。真没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是受够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样下去没意思了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也老了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有这档节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从今往后就只谈这个吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so let's just leave it at that from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们很特别。我们之间有感情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're special. We have a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一段带着老婆的感情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A thing with a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再被玩弄了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm over being played.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你买了房子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bought you a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能这样。是我造就了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't do this. I made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好带着你那副没用的、只会利用人的德性\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better get your rundown, good-for-nothing, user ass
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立刻滚出我的办公室，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}out of my office right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我不只是跟你了断这么简单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or I won't just be done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这儿干到头了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will be done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也许你会记住，是谁成就了谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then maybe you'll remember who made who.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:56.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发型还行吗？行。不，你美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is my hair okay? Okay. No, you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没被选上集体约会，好像挺吃醋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you seemed pretty jealous that you weren't chosen for the group date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:07:59.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃醋？嗯，可能让我有点想……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jealous? Well, I guess it kind of made me want...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，嘿。能跟你聊两句吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey. Can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你有大麻吧？给我弄点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you got weed, right? Hook me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，没有。我一点都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no. I don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我以为你有那种医疗用的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A-and I thought you had some, like, health stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我心脏瓣膜有点毛病。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I got a weird valve thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可能会晕倒，但不会死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could faint. I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你到底在乎什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you give a crap for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去给我们弄点大麻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Score us some weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫辆豪华轿车，再做两个泰式按摩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get a limo, maybe a couple of Thai massages,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们兜兜风，好好玩一天，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we'll drive around, we'll make a day of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我？大团圆结局，长长久久！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and me? Happy ending, long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我只需要把电恢复一天……就一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I-I just need the power turned back on for one... one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们很容易就能补缴欠税。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we can easily pay the back taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是问题。不！不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a problem. No! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你别……别让我一直等着。求……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't... please don't put me on hold. Ple...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，瑞秋？马上到我办公室来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Rachel? In my office, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:41.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，我在处理葡萄园的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, uh, I'm working on the vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是遇到点小麻烦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just am having a little bit of trouble with...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，别提了，葡萄园\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, the vineyard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是今早克伦威尔家的破事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}was this morning's Cromwell douchery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是那混蛋今天下午给我们爆的料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's what that twat is throwing at us this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在跟前女友发色情短信？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sexting with his ex?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他怎么拿到手机的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did he get a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开什么玩笑？不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding me? Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信他们没提前通知你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot believe they didn't give you the head's up on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，我那边的联系人还在生我的气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, my contact there is still mad at me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:08:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}气我上一季怎么耍了他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at how I played them last season,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我没想到他会坑我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I didn't realize that he was gonna screw me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没来得及给他买块新劳力士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before I had a chance to buy him a new Rolex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他从这里给她发短信？好吧，抱歉，但我以为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's texting her from here? Okay, I'm sorry, but I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:08.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为她跟他分手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought that she broke up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，显然没有，好吗？我们得赶在事情闹大前处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, well, apparently not, okay? We need to get ahead of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道那些女孩会怎么做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know what those girls are gonna do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果她们发现他还跟那个皮帕翻版有联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if they find out that he's still in touch with his Pippa wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，她们会把他阉了，观众也会想这么干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they're gonna chop his balls off just like our viewers will want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我来对媒体做危机公关，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I will run damage control with the press,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我需要你让那个发色情短信的疯子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I need you to get that sext maniac
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在镜头前道歉，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to apologize on camera, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他得让全世界相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He needs to convince the world
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在乎来这儿这件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that he gives a crap about being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，算我们走运，他特别会撒谎。对，但说真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, lucky for us, he's a damn good liar. Yeah, but seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这混蛋到底懂不懂这一行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does this douchebag not get about this business, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在这儿卖的是真爱！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are selling true love here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真爱啊，各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True love, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能不能有点隐私？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A little privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}万一我在打飞机呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if I was having a wank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:55.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞什么鬼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道这会让节目冒多大风险吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any idea how much that jeopardizes the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才不会。在我老家，小报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't. Back home, the tabloids
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天天写我家的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}write about my family all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不理它。它就过去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We ignore it. It goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:06.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，在美国这儿，呃，对我们的观众来说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, here in America, uh, to our audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《星捕手》就是《纽约时报》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Starcatcher is the New York Times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也没打算让它公开啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I didn't intend for it to go public.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打不打算根本不重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It really doesn't even matter what you intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底为什么偏偏现在开始给她发短信？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why in the hell would you start texting with her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无聊。罗格给了我一部手机。你想让我怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was bored. Rog gave me a phone. What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:20.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让你别这么孬，老实承认。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to stop being such a little bitch and cop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去跟那些女孩道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Apologize to those girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我怎么会指望你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, and why would I expect you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对任何事负责呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be responsible for anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那破败的烂葡萄园，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your crappy broken-down vineyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你偷偷让格蕾丝给你口交，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, your secret hummers from grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还跟那个公开羞辱你、甩了你的前女友发色情短信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and sexting the ex who publicly humiliated and dumped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，亚当？你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know something, Adam? You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续练你的腹肌吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just keep working on your abs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事我来处理，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I will deal with it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}手机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，把这些预算\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, get these budgets
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽快送到电视台，再联系《星捕手》试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over to the network A.S.A.P. and try Starcatcher again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们，要是不接我电话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them if they don't take my call,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就亲自过去，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna come over there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我的马诺洛高跟鞋塞进他们每个恶心屁股里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and shove my Manolos up every one of their slimy asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……去吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以走了。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩。真是惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn. Pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，呃，对我来说也是个惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, uh, it was a surprise for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:37.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚餐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托告诉我那是纳帕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please tell me that that was Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-拜托。  -泰式按摩店。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please.   -Thai massage parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特……他想一起聚聚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet... He wants to hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我觉得就是这次了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I think this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得这是我向他推销节目创意的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think this is my chance to pitch him my idea for a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧，随便。县管理员那边怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine, whatever. What's up with the county manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，他们拒绝发放通电许可证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, they're refusing to issue a permit to turn on the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我一点进展都没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm getting nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰里米在加班准备场地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Jeremy's working overtime to prep the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特在那边有几个朋友……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Chet's got some pals up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个当地政客，还给我们办了场派对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some local politician guy who threw us a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！那太好了。我让昆恩请切特去跟他朋友说说。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah! That is great. I will ask Quinn to have Chet talk to his friend. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，还是算了。为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, or not. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸妈在吵架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy and daddy are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:22.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。真抱歉我来晚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. So sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在正是季中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the middle of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道是怎么回事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是灰雁伏特加，加冰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still Grey Goose, rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想把我灌醉，好让我放浪起来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you trying to get me drunk and slutty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，我希望这通电话意味着你想通了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I hope this call means that you've come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来喝酒的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've come for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是来谈你那荒唐的官司的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not here for your crazy lawsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么不？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特从我们俩手里偷走了《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet stole "Everlasting" from both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:51.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没有证据。只是你的一面之词对他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got no proof. It's your word against his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事真的不值得谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's really not worth talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:58.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你能找到你最初的创意样册。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not unless you were to find your original lookbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好多年没见过那东西了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't seen that thing in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这官司根本打不起来，比尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The lawsuit's a non-starter, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱要不要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:11.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你一点没变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这我承认。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是变老了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've just gotten older.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:18.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有更聪明。更性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And smarter. Sexier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:19.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我几乎能原谅你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can almost forgive you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:22.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让切特把你从我身边抢走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for letting Chet steal you away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会想你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事你应付得来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it something you can handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。我很快回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接啊，快接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:40.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:42.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯雷，疯雷，怎么样啊，姑娘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crazy Ray, crazy Ray, what up, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，呃，那个，好像\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, uh, well, it seems
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在纳帕遇到点小问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I'm having a little bit of problems in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来亚当在那边的房产欠了些税\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It turns out that Adam owes some back taxes on his property there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}县里拒绝发放重新通电的许可证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the county is refusing to issue a permit to turn the electricity back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:54.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}需要我出面吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need me to step in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实听说你在那边认识个政客，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I do hear that you know a politician there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I was hoping maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能，就是，打个电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you could just, you know, make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要通电一天就行。我就这点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only talking about power for one day. That's all I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:03.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是一条船上的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're all in it together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。是啊。没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哥们儿布鲁克斯能搞定纳帕那边的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My buddy Brooks can take care of things up in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:11.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}官僚混蛋们听到老板发话就会听话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bureaucratic a-holes tend to listen when the boss speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那太好了。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would be great. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太感谢了。不用谢我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks a lot. No need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会找到办法让你回报我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll find a way for you to pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波波！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bo-Bo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:34.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘。佩珀。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Psst. Pepper. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我大概不该说什么，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I probably shouldn't say anything, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:15:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，女士们，谁准备好做集体约会准备了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, ladies, who is ready for group date prep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。莎米卡和佩珀，我不知道你们俩为什么在这。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Shamiqua and Pepper, I don't know why you two are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们来是要答案的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're here because we want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，呃，我完全理解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, um, I totally understand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没被选上去约会很难受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it sucks not to be picked for a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证还会有别的约会。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise you that there will be other dates. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是觉得该让大家知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just thought we should let everyone here know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们要跟谁去约会……一个大骗子。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who they'd be going on a date with... a big fat liar. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—没错。  -—就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yep.   -That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.29,0:15:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，让我先弄清楚这事，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys, let me just get to the bottom of this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:23.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上回来。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be right back. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们上钩了。放亚当进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They took the bait. Send in Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在全看他的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all on him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅典娜给我看的时候，我就想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when Athena showed me, I just thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}「你知道吗，佩珀？其他姑娘应该知道。」\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"you know what, Pepper? Those other girls deserve to know."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他绝对没法解释掉这事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is no way he can explain this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:45.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你觉得他扛得住吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, you think he's up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我觉得亚当连修女都能迷得脱裤子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I think Adam could charm the panties off a nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:49.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}葡萄园那边怎么样了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on with the vineyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不得不找切特帮忙，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to ask Chet for some help, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:54.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找他认识的纳帕那边的一个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with some guy that he knows up in Napa
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:56.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把电通上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to get the electricity turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这选择不错，但切特不做白帮忙的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's a good choice, but Chet doesn't do favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:02.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会想要回报，你最好做好准备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna want something, and you'd better be ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当到片场了。我们待命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam's on the set. We're standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A机拍亚当，B机、C机拍姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A" cam on Adam, "B," "C" on girls, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好，女士们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，他们现在给我们安排了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what do they have planned for us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出什么事了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么不问问你的未婚妻？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you ask your fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你喜欢别人，为什么不直接跟她在一起？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're into somebody else, why don't you just be with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.05,0:16:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……而不是跟我们所有人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... Instead of all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我觉得其实……搞错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I think there's actually... there's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去看看能不能找到人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just gonna see if I can find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:28.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will... I will be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然想跟我们解释……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he's gonna try and tell us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说过你会处理这件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said you were gonna take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我这就是在让你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, and that's exactly what I'm doing by letting you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己收拾烂摊子。那不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}clean up your own mess. Well, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们拿到那本破杂志不是我的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not my problem they got their hands on that stupid magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这绝对是你的问题，这次得你自己去解决。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It absolutely is your problem, and for once, you're gonna be the one to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我到底要怎么解决？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how the hell am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些女孩每一个都是你女朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Each one of those girls is your girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都想嫁给你，但现在她们很生气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who wants to marry you, but right now they're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，听着，如果我是你女朋友，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, listen, if I was your girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也会生气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would be pissed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会跟我说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What would you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你是我女朋友？对啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you were my girlfriend? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会跟我说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What would you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很喜欢这个眼线，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really like the eyeliner,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稍微保养一下，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and with a little bit of upkeep,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你其实很有潜力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you could really be something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在把这乘以10。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now multiply that by 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才叫生活，对吧，杰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the life, isn't it, Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:18.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全同意，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Totally, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，你得接受生活给你的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you have to take what life offers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:27.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直视它，拥抱它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}look it in the eye, and embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，就像我有个节目创意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's just like this idea I had for a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是关于重组家庭的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's about blended families, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}单亲妈妈或爸爸选个新配偶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like a single mom or dad choosing a new spouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:43.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但孩子可以投票。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the kids get to vote on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由他们决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They make the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:47.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我管它叫《家庭搅拌机》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm calling it "Family Blender."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:50.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:53.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. I'm Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:18:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不，没事，不用不用不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, yeah, yeah, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你怎么能做这种事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could you do something like this, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们！姑娘们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Girls! Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:17.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有话要说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让人家说句话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give the man a chance to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:20.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该有个合理的解释，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's probably a reasonable explanation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你，雅典娜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Athena.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实……我确实开始给我前未婚妻发短信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... the truth is, I did start texting my ex-fiancée
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在罗格来看我之后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after Rog came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:31.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗格让我想起了家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rog reminded me of home,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想起和我一起长大的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the people I grew up with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们觉得我上这个节目很傻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who think it's silly for me to be on this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们觉得这配不上我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They think it's beneath me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……我知道听起来很势利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which... It sounds snobbish, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我听进去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为当你生在某个阶层，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because when you're born into a certain class,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只该嫁给一种人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's only one kind of person you're supposed to marry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和你一模一样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone exactly the same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在这里，和你们在一起，一切那么新鲜，那么不同，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But here, with all of you, it's so new, so different,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:54.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}充满可能性\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so filled with possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从来想象不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never could have possibly imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我突然明白了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I suddenly understood
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以和你们中的一个人拥有真实的东西，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I could have something real with one of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不只是我社会地位的反映，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not just a reflection of my social status,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是更深的、深刻的联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but a deeper, profound connection
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只属于我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that would be uniquely ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那让我害怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that frightened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你们想走，我不会怪你们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't blame any of you if you wanted to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:16.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然我真的很希望你们别走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}although I really hope you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我为我的懦弱道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm sorry for acting like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的想要真实的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do want something real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.59,0:19:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的愿意接受爱的可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am truly open to the possibility of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你们也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I hope you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有两下子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太美了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's beautiful, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时你真让我害怕，你太厉害了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes you scare me, you're so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那全是他自己说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was all him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该领功就领功。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take credit where it's due.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在确保你刚救回来的那场约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now make sure that that date that you just saved
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别变成一场灾难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}isn't a total disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请切到A机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut to "A" camera, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又在跟你的小跟班密谋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Plotting with your little minion again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我之前跟她聊得挺愉快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a nice little chat with her earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我听说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说你离开片场去吃晚饭了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear you left set for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去哪儿了？其实是去约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'd you go? A date, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟杰去哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'd you go off to with Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.02,0:20:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你早知道我会发现。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You knew I'd find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都看见你和你的那些骚货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody saw you and your sluts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得收工了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们早上出发去纳帕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We leave for Napa in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，纳帕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right. Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}辛西娅特别期待。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cynthia's really looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁克斯和凯莉想四人约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks and Kelly want to double date,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝贺我们有了孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}congratulate us on the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你可以来跟我们喝一杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe you can join us for a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:53.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你要慢慢地走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, so you are gonna stroll slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.99,0:20:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只有60英尺可用空间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We only have 60 feet of usable space
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你的葡萄园就是个腐烂的粪坑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since your vineyard is a rotting shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:20:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。呃，30分钟后开机，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Uh, cameras up in 30 minutes, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只有八小时可用日光来完成今天的拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got eight hours of useable sunlight to make my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}A机位有人盯着吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we have eyes on camera "A"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在你后面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}清场，各位。这是清场拍摄！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just clear, people. It's a clear set!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:09.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好了就告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望那个人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope that the person
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我选择共度余生的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I choose to spend the rest of my life with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会像我一样爱上这个神奇的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will come to love this magical place as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好啊，兄弟。最近怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, mate. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我完全不知道那又是哪一层新地狱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I have no idea what fresh circle of hell that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但以防万一，继续拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but keep rolling just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待在我后面。给我点空间。嗨。对，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay behind me. Give me some space. Hi. Yeah. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，这几位是生意伙伴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, these are some business associates
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今年早些时候在圣特罗佩认识的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I met in San Tropez earlier this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们刚飞过来看看，呃，葡萄园。很高兴认识你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They just flew in to come see the, um, the vineyard. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。哦，真好。太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Oh, nice. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，各位能失陪一下吗？当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, will you guys excuse us for one second? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:44.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证马上把他带回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will bring him right back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，各位。太感谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, guys. Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一下。非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One second. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:48.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们是潜在投资人，所以让节目在这里拍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're potential investors, so having the show here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能让他们看到我能获得什么样的曝光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will show them the kind of publicity I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道奎恩会怎么对我吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know what Quinn's gonna do to me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果她看到这些家伙在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if she sees these guys here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会把我脑袋拧下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna rip my head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是“给亚当·克伦威尔拉投资秀”，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not the "Fund Adam Cromwell Show," okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这纯粹是个童话故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a straight-up fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，求你了。我需要这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, please. I need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能回到我父亲那里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't go back to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能看到他得意的脸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't see his smug face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当他看到我又失败了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when he sees that I have failed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.59,0:22:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的做不到，好吗？我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just can't, okay? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.63,0:22:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，如果我帮你这个忙，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, if I do this for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得帮我做件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，什么都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次约会我需要一个吻，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a kiss on this date, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管对象是谁，但我要你在其他女孩面前吻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care who it's with, but I want you to do it in front of the other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真想要这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's really what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我真真正正想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I really, really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伸舌头还是不伸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tongue or no tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你演得逼真。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让人内裤湿透。我要让人手心冒汗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want dripping panties. I want sweaty palms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:38.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要激烈，我要火热。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want it intense, and I want it hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我去叫他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. I'll grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。呃，刚才抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Uh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.05,0:23:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我以为你是在给他做制片工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I thought that you were producing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道会发展成那样。显然，什么都播不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know where it was going. Obviously, nothing's useable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:10.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我不知道你以为你看到了什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, I don't know what you think you saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我只是在做他的制片工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I was just producing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题。这段素材都归你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No problem. The footage is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.13,0:23:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:19.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸好我开了张新卡，所以没被记录。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucky I started a new card, so it's not logged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:20.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会发现的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nobody will miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我想谢谢你通宵工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I want to thank you for working through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这里整理好。这真的很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to get the place in shape. It really means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.60,0:23:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你跟奎恩提了这事，这对我很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it means a lot to me that you had a word with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果我发现，我不讨厌当老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turns out I don't hate being the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:33.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没跟奎恩说过什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't say anything to Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么说你去说了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why'd you say that you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我是说我会去说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I said I was going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也打算去，只是……那时候，就像，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I was, I just... It was, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有事情都赶在一起，时机不对，而且，你看，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}bad timing with everything, and, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是靠自己得到这份工作的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you got the job on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不需要我替你说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't even need me to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.80,0:23:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当然配得上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You deserve it, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.53,0:23:54.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。是啊，那还用说，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, no shit, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今天把你们大家带到这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I brought you all here today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来到我第一处正式产业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to my first official property
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我在你们每个人身上都看到了成为我未来妻子的潜力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I see in each of you the potential to be my future wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.85,0:24:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我的妻子必须在所有事情上都是我的伴侣，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But any wife of mine will need to be my partner in all things,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:16.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括这家酒庄，它正需要一款招牌酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}including this winery, which is in need of a signature wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:18.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要把不同品种混酿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be blending different varieties
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找出最适合我们的那一款。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to discover the one that's just right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，玩得开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.83,0:24:29.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倒，倒，倒。我要那些女孩喝起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pour, pour, pour. I want those girls drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要她们玩得开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want them having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要她们玩得太过火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want them having too much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:37.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在嘴里漱一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, swish it around in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.81,0:24:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在用感官判断风味轮廓，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Use your senses now to determine a flavor profile,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:43.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们姑且这么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we'll call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.25,0:24:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我们基本上是求着亚当来这里拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we had to basically beg Adam to shoot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通常，我们得花一大笔钱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Normally, we'd pay through the nose
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}才能和克伦威尔这样的奢侈品牌合作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be in business with a luxury brand like Cromwell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并在这样的庄园里拍摄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and shoot in an estate like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像这样的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.12,0:24:56.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊，这地方……这地方是块璞玉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, this place... this place is a diamond in the rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，我在这里尝到的是，呃，黑莓？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, here I'm getting, uh, blackberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我觉得就像酸葡萄汁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, it just tastes like sour grape juice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但真的很好喝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好喝。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so good. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.17,0:25:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你该被取消资格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you should be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.58,0:25:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是干这行的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do this for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.71,0:25:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不像是很爱喝酒的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't strike me as much of a drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.05,0:25:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……这让你不舒服吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this... Is this unpleasant for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.35,0:25:22.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这辈子做过很多难事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've had to do a lot of difficult things in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在漂亮的酒庄待一下午，还不算太糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spending the afternoon in a beautiful winery isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.16,0:25:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，听着，你想去走走吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, listen, do you want to go for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.70,0:25:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很乐意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.17,0:25:37.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好喝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.80,0:25:40.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.11,0:25:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样更健康。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's healthier.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.67,0:25:43.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定是更健康的选择。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the healthier option, for sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.34,0:25:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……停，停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全不喝酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't drink at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全不喝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.98,0:25:51.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.18,0:25:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太美了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，亚当。很有品味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Way to go, Adam. Good style.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.70,0:26:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们该看这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we supposed to be watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不好意思，这也太俗气了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, but that's just tacky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.21,0:26:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴你喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I am glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很期待看新一期，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I look forward to reading the new issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.35,0:26:24.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望这次少点惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}hopefully this time with fewer surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:27.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:29.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我肯定不想知道那是什么意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure I don't want to know what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.12,0:26:30.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你确实不想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.02,0:26:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我，呃，我正打算把这些留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I was, uh, I was just gonna leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.13,0:26:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还以为你在纳帕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you'd be in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.03,0:26:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被抓包了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.87,0:26:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如你一起来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you come with?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些女孩都快把你生吞了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those girls were ready to eat you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你替我说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, thank you for sticking up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.41,0:26:48.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很感激。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:52.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以继续帮你，挺你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could keep helping you, have your back,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.04,0:26:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要你把我留下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you keep me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.01,0:26:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还以为你想让我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And here I thought you wanted us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.75,0:26:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}共度余生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to spend the rest of our lives together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.08,0:27:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现实中的你和我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and me in real life...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.29,0:27:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道从哪开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't even know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.26,0:27:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我进四强，我就做你的僚机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get me to the final four, and I'll be your wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.06,0:27:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成交？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，雅典娜，我需要你回去和其他女孩待着，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Athena, I need you back with the other girls, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:16.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听着，昆恩15分钟后到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, Quinn is gonna be here in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能让她在片场撞见那些人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't have her catch those guys on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:22.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我尽力了，但他们得走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did what I could, but they got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.88,0:27:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没机会做我的提案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't had a chance to make my pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是做这事的目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the whole point of doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.94,0:27:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我需要更多时间。  -嘿，亚当，亚当！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I need more time.   -Hey, Adam, Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.82,0:27:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你见过我妻子辛西娅吗？呃，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You met my wife, Cynthia? Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.28,0:27:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我没见过。你好。幸会。哦，哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't believe I have. Hi. Charmed. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.85,0:27:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白切特为什么把你藏起来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can see why Chet keeps you hidden away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.02,0:27:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，奉承话加上这口音。我嗅到今年高收视率了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, flattery and the accent. I smell big ratings this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.09,0:27:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位是布鲁克斯，他可爱的妻子凯莉。你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Brooks, his lovely wife, Kelly. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁克斯在纳帕可是大人物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks is a big deal up here at Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.13,0:27:46.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你们家的超级粉丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a huge fan of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.30,0:27:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我得知你要成为今年的追求者时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I found out that you were going to be this year's suitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.14,0:27:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我差点激动死了，好吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just about died, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，嘿。你们好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.97,0:27:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样吧，各位，不如我带你们去别的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you guys, what if I take you guys somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.91,0:27:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松一下，懂吗？听起来不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for you to relax, you know? Does that sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.34,0:27:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:27:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。那给我一秒钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Well, give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，亲爱的，特殊任务。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, sweetie, special assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.75,0:28:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你带这些人去礼拜堂，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to take these guys to the chapel, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.75,0:28:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让他们离开。不惜一切代价。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not let them leave. Do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.99,0:28:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺厉害的，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretty good, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.99,0:28:10.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可不是嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他到底在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.33,0:28:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，好久不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, it's a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，这混蛋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, this jagoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来工作的，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here to do my job, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔是我的客人。忍着吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill's my guest. Deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.98,0:28:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，你想引起我注意，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you want to get my attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没必要在阴沟里打滚，昆恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you don't have to roll around in the gutter, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:34.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别那样跟她说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't talk to her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认真的？等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，她现在可是成年人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, she's actually a grown-up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.85,0:28:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们……我们像成年人一样谈话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We... we talk like adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，呃，自从她意识到自己能找到更好的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh, ever since she realized how much better she could do,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也像成年人一样上床了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we've been screwing like grown-ups, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.19,0:28:48.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，看来她，呃，重新考虑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it seems like she's, uh, reconsidered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.83,0:28:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那我该觉得受威胁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, am I supposed to feel threatened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.83,0:28:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要拿那场大官司来对付我吗？你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you gonna come after me with that big lawsuit? You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.23,0:28:55.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们至少能装装成年人吗？都八年了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we at least pretend like we're adults? You know, it's been eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.50,0:28:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么都没能证明。你知道自己做了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You haven't been able to prove a thing. You know what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.90,0:28:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我建立了一个帝国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I've built an empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢，你这个没才华的废物？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about you, you no-talent hack?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.34,0:29:04.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对了，你在动物星球频道有过一个节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's right, you had a show on the Animal Planet
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被取消了，然后你就放弃了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that got canceled and you gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.38,0:29:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的？你们能不能管好下半身，拜托？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously? Can you guys just keep it in your pants, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对了。你才是高雅的那个。行吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's right. You're the classy one. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.82,0:29:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在巷子里吐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're throwing up in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戒瘾所，对吧？没错，我是个酒鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rehab, right? Yes, I'm a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.35,0:29:16.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我不是骗子，不是小偷，也不是出轨的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm not a liar or a thief or a cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.92,0:29:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个没用的废物！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You worthless piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在逗我吗？哦，嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding me? Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.59,0:29:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们看起来像白痴，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look like idiots, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.56,0:29:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在还有观众了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now we have an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.47,0:29:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是再敢出现在我的片场，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ever show up on my set again,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一拳打得你拉出牙来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll punch you so hard, you'll be crapping teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.91,0:29:40.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戏演完了，各位！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Show's over, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:42.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我才预计会有稳定增长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is why I'm anticipating steady growth
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.18,0:29:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等前期开销收回之后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}once the initial overhead is paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.05,0:29:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，这是笔极具吸引力的投资。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an extremely attractive investment, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:48.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你的制片人吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your producer, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.22,0:29:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，对。是的，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, yeah. Yes, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她，呃，确实很有说服力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is, uh, certainly convincing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.19,0:29:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于自带宣传效应这一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about the built-in publicity angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.02,0:29:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:56.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到这一步没她我该怎么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what I'd do without her at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.13,0:29:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。行。让我去跟我的人谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. All right. Let me go to my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想他们会迫不及待跟克伦威尔酒店集团合作的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think they'll leap at the chance to get in bed with Cromwell Hospitality Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.90,0:30:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，其实，我会，呃，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, actually, I will be, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.44,0:30:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会独自经营这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will be running this place alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.40,0:30:07.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我很有信心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I have full confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.97,0:30:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我花了很长时间在我父亲身边学习，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've spent a lot of time learning by my father's side,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.88,0:30:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.18,0:30:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你也许正在获得一些名气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, you may be gaining some fame
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.35,0:30:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在美国主妇当中，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with American housewives,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但老兄，你就是个行走的小报头条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, mate, you're a walking tabloid headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.45,0:30:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，等等。听我说完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, wait. Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.99,0:30:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你父亲也加入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get your father onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.15,0:30:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有他在，就一帆风顺了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With him, it's smooth sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.29,0:30:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光靠你自己，没人会把你当回事，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You alone, nobody's gonna take you seriously, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.13,0:30:29.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.56,0:30:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，是啊。不，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, yeah. No, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.23,0:30:36.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……抱歉浪费你们时间了，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... sorry to have wasted your time, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.37,0:30:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.28,0:30:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底谁拿着我的麦克风？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who the hell has my mike?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.28,0:30:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我。有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me that. Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.15,0:30:53.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}混蛋。那算什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prick. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.25,0:30:55.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不为你工作，老兄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't work for you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.02,0:30:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的追求者怎么不在镜头里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is my suitor not on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.16,0:31:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我刚要带他进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I was just bringing him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.06,0:31:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？因为看起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? Because it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是在制作我付钱让你做的节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}instead of producing the show I pay you to work on,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是在里面开该死的鸡尾酒会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you were in there having a damn cocktail party.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我花在亚当身上的每一刻，不管在不在镜头前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, every moment I spend producing Adam on or off camera
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是为了让他更好控制。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}makes him easier to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你知道我就是那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know that I'm the person
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:14.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教你这句鬼话的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who taught you that bullshitty line,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.11,0:31:17.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以别用下半身思考了，干好你的活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so stop thinking with your clit and do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们送你上去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let's get you up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.59,0:31:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.99,0:31:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要是想自己走二十英尺可不得了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God forbid I try to walk 20 feet on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.39,0:31:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，发生的事我很抱歉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm sorry about what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.30,0:31:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，但也许等你爸看到这节目……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, but maybe once your dad sees the show...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.00,0:31:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目就是个笑话，瑞秋，我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show's a joke, Rachel, and so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.27,0:31:45.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.51,0:31:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，谁能给这位扫兴鬼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, will somebody please give Debbie Downer
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.41,0:31:55.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狠狠来一脚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a royal kick in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.58,0:31:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟比尔到底在搞什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing with Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.18,0:31:58.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行啊，我想干什么就干什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, whatever the hell I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.65,0:32:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个无名小卒。不再是了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a nobody. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.15,0:32:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他生活井井有条，而且没结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has his life together and he's not married.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.65,0:32:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！我认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.99,0:32:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是一样的，你和我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're the same, you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而比尔会把你无聊到哭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Bill's gonna bore you to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该有自己的生活，切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I deserve to have a life, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.53,0:32:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我拥有它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.03,0:32:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彩排倒计时，三，二，一，格拉汉姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rehearsing in three, two, one, and Graham.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.53,0:32:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们每个人都收到了开始这一天的邀请，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Each of you received an invitation to start the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:21.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你们每个人也会收到结束这一天的邀请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and each of you will receive an invitation to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，A机，对准亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, "A" camera, on Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-开始吧。  -开机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's do this.   -Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.38,0:32:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，正如你们在台上看到的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As you can see onstage, ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有写着你们名字的信封。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we have envelopes with your names on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.18,0:32:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中两个信封是空的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two of these envelopes are empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.42,0:32:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就是说，很遗憾，你们中有两个人该回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which means for a pair of you, sadly, it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.40,0:32:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:49.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见鬼。见鬼，不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell. Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.60,0:32:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.77,0:32:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你撒谎了。哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lied. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.24,0:32:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。你耍我，我就耍你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. You play me, I'll play you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.61,0:32:56.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊。来啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.18,0:32:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1号机，跟着雅典娜。对，跟着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera 1, follow Athena. Yeah, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅典娜。我不会停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Athena. I am not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.11,0:33:01.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会告诉你们发生了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will tell you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们没听到我们的对话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Y'all didn't hear the conversation we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.48,0:33:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要告诉你们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.52,0:33:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你愿意顶替我其他投资人的位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're willing to step in for my other investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对这个地方有个构想。彻底重塑品牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had a vision for this place. Total re-branding.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永恒水疗度假村……还有金矿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Everlasting Spa and Resort... and goldmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.73,0:33:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来，是啊，很棒。真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds, yeah, lovely. It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.73,0:33:22.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对这个连锁品牌来说是很棒的投资。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an excellent investment for the franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.37,0:33:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁克斯这边持有20%的股份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brooks here would hold a 20% share.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.10,0:33:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}隐名合伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Silent partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.37,0:33:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会让你们来经营。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd let you folks run things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.81,0:33:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们帮亚当拿到他那六千万，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We get Adam his $60 mil,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.48,0:33:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们三个就有了台葡萄酒乡的提款机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the three of us have ourselves a wine-country ATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.44,0:33:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得怎么样，亲爱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.61,0:33:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来怎么样？我很喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How's that all sound to you? I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.78,0:33:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会准备司康饼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have scones
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.75,0:33:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再配上凝脂奶油喝茶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and clotted cream for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.59,0:33:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}场面会非常浪漫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我总是让她说最后一句话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I always let her have the last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.56,0:33:48.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婚姻才能维系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Makes a marriage work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:56.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯莉还有个最后的要求，算是敲定这笔交易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kelly's got, uh, one last request just to seal the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.20,0:33:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.37,0:34:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，不惜一切代价。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.17,0:34:02.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得他们在乎美国的黑人女性吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think they care about a black woman in America?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.54,0:34:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有种就来对付我试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just try coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.48,0:34:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会把一切都告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.62,0:34:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会告死你。又一个黑人婊子栽了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll sue your ass. Another black bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，她会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, she's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.79,0:34:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她聪明得很，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's super smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走的时候还不忘打种族牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}working the race card on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.86,0:34:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会得到疯狂的媒体关注。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna get crazy press.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.46,0:34:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会上一圈脱口秀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna do the talk-show circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她甚至可能把这事编进自己的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She might even work it into her own show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这就是游戏规则，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's the game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.53,0:34:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会成为我族人的真正英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'll be a real hero for my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.44,0:34:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看见亚当了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you seen Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.44,0:34:36.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，他刚才和切特走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he went off with Chet awhile ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.54,0:34:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.56,0:35:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在熬夜加班？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You burning the midnight oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.80,0:35:35.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是给切特P张图。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just Photoshopping something for Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.74,0:35:39.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.94,0:35:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你不知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.54,0:35:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特和布鲁克斯要投资亚当的葡萄园，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet and Brooks are investing in Adam's vineyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.68,0:35:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它打造成“永恒”品牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}branding it as "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:49.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很巧妙，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's ingenious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.35,0:35:50.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.78,0:35:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你归我管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the one you report to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.88,0:35:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，我只是照切特的要求做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, I was just doing what Chet asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.72,0:35:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.22,0:35:58.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被解雇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:36:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.23,0:36:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我为你干了三年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, I have worked for you for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.00,0:36:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.90,0:36:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我唯一应得的就是忠诚，杰，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The one thing I deserve is loyalty, Jay,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你整季都在拍错人的马屁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you spent this whole season kissing the wrong ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.70,0:36:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.87,0:36:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你-你去说吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Y-you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去告诉你老板你想让我走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go tell your boss you want me gone
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我确信切特不想因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause I'm pretty sure Chet doesn't want a harassment suit
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.41,0:36:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我给他找妓女和大麻而吃上骚扰官司。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for making me find him hookers and weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，尤其是被一个黑人同性恋告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, especially not a suit from a black, gay man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.29,0:36:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会做完这一季，奎恩，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll finish the season, Quinn,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.49,0:36:34.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后我就去给切特的新节目干活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and after that, I'll be working for Chet on his new shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你等着瞧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.70,0:36:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你很特别？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you're special?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会把你榨干再吐出来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll use you up and spit you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.47,0:36:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像他对其他人那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just like he does everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.94,0:36:47.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你来说好像还挺顺利的嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seems to have worked out pretty well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.34,0:36:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又不是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.35,0:37:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.79,0:37:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走的时候我看见你了，可我那会儿正忙得脱不开身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saw you as you were leaving, but I sort of had my hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.76,0:37:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。那是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.53,0:37:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的葡萄园拿到投资了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got my vineyard financed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.03,0:37:17.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天唯一想要的事，我做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only thing I wanted out of today, and I made it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.30,0:37:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，所以你是个男妓咯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, so you're a whore, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少凯莉享受了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, at least Kelly enjoyed herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.91,0:37:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比你睡的那些人强多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is more than I can say for the people you screw.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.61,0:37:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很为此自豪，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's something you're proud of, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.68,0:37:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是追求者，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the suitor, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.95,0:37:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不记得自豪是什么感觉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't remember what pride feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.95,0:37:35.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲跟我断绝了关系，罗杰骗了我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father disowned me, Roger lied to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.59,0:37:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的前未婚妻为了点快钱和名气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and my ex-fiancée sold me out to bloy Starcatcher
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.36,0:37:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把我卖给了“追星者”博客。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for a quick buck and some notoriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.72,0:37:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道的？你到底怎么知道的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you know that? How do you exactly know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.33,0:37:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么知道？是啊，你怎么知道的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do I know that? Yeah, how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.63,0:37:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是知道。不然怎么会传出去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just know. How else did it get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.83,0:37:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信不过任何人帮我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't trust anyone to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.46,0:37:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我做了该做的事，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I did what I had to do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.90,0:37:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我真不敢相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I can't really believe
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.84,0:37:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在经历了这一切之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that after everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.57,0:37:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在今天节目为你做了这一切之后，你居然会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after everything the show did for you today that you would...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.10,0:37:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在想让我信任这个节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want me to trust the show now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.98,0:37:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.38,0:38:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看着你让成年女人哭都不带犹豫的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've watched you make grown women cry without thinking twice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.61,0:38:05.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在你眼里就是这样的人，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's who I am to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.08,0:38:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我的制片人，而这是个游戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my producer, and this is a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:09.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不就是你一直跟我说的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that what you're telling me all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对。我是你的制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right. I'm your producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在下班了，所以别来烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And right now I'm off the clock, so get out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“永恒水疗度假村”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everlasting Resort and Spa?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.08,0:38:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？这可以很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right? This could be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.78,0:38:39.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让你按自己的想法设计整个东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I want you to design the whole thing any way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.55,0:38:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你会把它做得完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know you're gonna make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.49,0:38:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:48.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我，一起干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and me, working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.56,0:38:49.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}设计它？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Design it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我设计“永恒”那样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like how I designed "Everlasting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这档赚了几十亿的节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show that's raked in billions of dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.97,0:38:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我却连一份股份都没有，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I don't even have a stake in,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.57,0:39:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这档我随时还可能被开除的节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the show that I could still be fired from at any minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.07,0:39:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开除？你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fired? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我的一切都夺走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have taken everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.15,0:39:15.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再这样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.52,0:39:21.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，那个，听着。我搞砸了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, um, look. I, uh, I messed up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.03,0:39:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我撒谎了，就为了当英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I lied so I could be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.09,0:39:27.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是真的很想让你再跟我说说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just really wanted you to talk to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.20,0:39:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话虽如此，我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With that said, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.17,0:39:33.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我现在有莉齐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I have Lizzie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.51,0:39:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在一起生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've got a life together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.48,0:39:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:44.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.15,0:39:46.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心这家伙。你懂的，想清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful with this guy. You know, think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.92,0:39:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪家伙？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.79,0:39:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
